{'symbol': 'FSLR', 'date': '2021-02-25 16:05:00', 'title': 'FIRST SOLAR, INC. ANNOUNCES FOURTH QUARTER AND FULL YEAR 2020 FINANCIAL RESULTS AND 2021 GUIDANCE', 'text': 'TEMPE, ARIZ., FEB. 25, 2021 (GLOBE NEWSWIRE) -- FIRST SOLAR, INC. (NASDAQ: FSLR) TODAY ANNOUNCED FINANCIAL RESULTS FOR THE FOURTH QUARTER AND YEAR ENDED DECEMBER\xa031, 2020. NET SALES FOR THE FOURTH QUARTER WERE $0.6 BILLION, A DECREASE OF $0.3 BILLION FROM THE PRIOR QUARTER. THE DECREASE WAS PRIMARILY A RESULT OF HIGHER INTERNATIONAL PROJECT SALES IN THE THIRD QUARTER, WHICH WERE PARTIALLY OFFSET BY INCREASED MODULE SALES IN THE FOURTH QUARTER.'}